{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：21:56 2026-11-14 HKT</p>\n<p>衛蘭的《JANICE VIDAL 衛蘭 OUT OF FRAME 世界巡迴演唱會－香港站》共舉行4場，今晚（11月14日）舉行頭場。7時許場外已企滿等候入場的歌迷。場外亦擺放了不少花籃，當中包括「前老闆」黎明，花籃上擺滿了薯片，更印上金句：「Good Show，Good Luck，Show前唔好食，Show後馬上食。」另外又有張學友、容祖兒、張敬軒、莫文蔚、古巨基、張柏芝、梁詠琪、陳慧琳、楊千嬅、丁子高、方力申、炎明熹、王祖藍、李亞男等人，最令人驚喜的是，成龍大哥亦有致送花籃。至於到場睇騷的藝人包括蔡思貝、王君馨、鍾舒漫、泳兒、黃建東、Winka@COLLAR、雲浩影、黃淑蔓、洪嘉豪、梁思浩等。</p>\n<h2>衛蘭演唱近30首金曲</h2>\n<p>衛蘭以一身喑黑女王造型出場，從來旋轉階梯升降台中現身，先以《Break-a-way》、《My Cookie Can》、《一格格》幾首歌曲揭開序幕。衛蘭共會演唱近30首金曲，其中包括《心亂如麻》、《離家出走》、《你知道我在等你們分手嗎》、《就算世界無童話》、《愛才》等。</p>\n<img alt=\" 衛蘭以一身喑黑女王造型出場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/8dcbfa2c229caab9d39ea2dfae4def9d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_08_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"從旋轉階梯升降台中現身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/03aa43a7c4de371f75c13e25c658c259/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_08.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"以《Break-a-way》、《My Cookie Can》、《一格格》幾首歌曲揭開序幕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/3db7bba7c1cec26c164d0d46e5856c3d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_09_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"以《Break-a-way》、《My Cookie Can》、《一格格》幾首歌曲揭開序幕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/9a2a396a3337f8f828dc2aed8bb95c20/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_09_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"衛蘭共會演唱近30首金曲\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/06103562d72a87fcd65c04c542103a32/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_09.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"衛蘭的《JANICE VIDAL 衛蘭 OUT OF FRAME 世界巡迴演唱會－香港站》共舉行4場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/9ef44c4ba16a5b19ddbeab06d2ad1c8c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_10.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"今晚（11月14日）舉行頭場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/b8c67f560850221529553d7ee46c0bfa/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_11.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"全場歌迷亮起熒光棒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/4a09019524209702dc80cd3d45c1d9cb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_13_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"表情多多。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/616aace01c604d7b0847c4d838027262/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_13_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Janice大騷歌藝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/0f2d97ba228566bd91d8d7354deb94a8/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_13.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"歌迷反應熱烈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/ef73e704b26b5e6bdd27a881e6ba258a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_14.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎明花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/a4d648f435a0b79a0865332162870ae7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_50_24_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"容祖兒花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/a56a26023b3f40b9bcf00e97b4b08337/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_50_24_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張學友花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/610adc7a3a602def7d1208513571a09c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_50_24.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莫文蔚花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/92850710aca395b005e908a7881b983f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_50_25_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張敬軒花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/1e6df161dcf3d002378ae937f671e0c5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_50_25.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"古巨基花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/b0b12cf2831153b96d9c71e426dc2588/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_50_26_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張柏芝花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/6baa0ae88e3dd17b4fd56da879109ce5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_50_26_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"成龍花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/479f552ade7a5d28dfadb6fa8540accd/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_50_26.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁思浩花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/228091b78d6edde46440c5e53fabc73c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_50_56.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/b28076bb32a33f821d920860b24386c4/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_01.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍、李亞男花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/67bc76d4e9f233a6f6b34eef30f0d6e7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_02_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李昊花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/f2df8ba1059400a3ead9b6edce2b7772/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_02.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"炎明熹花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/346bae6c3716c5303224c219ce71fc73/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_03.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳慧琳花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/68af22e22064d34a8c900e5e0d7f5bf0/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_04_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方力申花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/81d755182b5515c549060a328180c6c2/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_04.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊千嬅、丁子高\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/37ec4d92ade74e7a5dc5757a399aa898/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_05.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡思貝、王君馨、鍾舒漫、泳兒、黃建東、Winka@COLLAR到場支持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/bdb88160e982123253674400ed136b56/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_05_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"雲浩影、黃淑蔓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/b264c474d29cf7b4a22d4a9f87ed7162/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_06.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁思浩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/117534a44bd19e345c839fb52cce73cd/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_07_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"洪嘉豪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/282633a6200cd1785887f3c37ca53f09/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_07.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>衛蘭與黃淑蔓隔空對唱</h2>\n<p>演唱會亮點相當多，衛蘭唱到經典歌曲時會全場大合唱，其中唱到《大哥》等歌曲時，衛蘭更企上環場360度高空吊籃繞場一周，中間更有黃淑蔓驚喜現身，在panel位前與衛蘭隔空對唱！之後台上衛蘭亦在talk位中感謝黎明、雷頌德發掘她。值得一提的是，整場演唱會都未見提字機，衛蘭記性相當之好！</p>\n<img alt=\"放小時候相片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/bbba15986563a14481f34e2f7339a410/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_01_38_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\" 演唱會亮點相當多。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/e734d1ce9ae83c33f7bc0e9ebd4583fa/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_01_39_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"舞台視覺效果令人驚喜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/f6147d78e08e97d54df8e5ae4efaf928/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_01_39_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"衛蘭唱到經典歌曲時會全場大合唱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/c23fadf66c7f7a58f406ca119aa1bbea/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_01_39_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"換了多套衣服。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/789c8a2fbcfb29642d94f2267a38d809/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_01_39.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鮮紅歌衫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/24539f463acbc3472de2d564b46d16eb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_01_40.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大騷歌藝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/0532bc59f2e71a1145126aa49e754b33/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_01_44.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"整場演唱會都未見提字機，衛蘭記性相當之好！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/3905a9eed548d38c8e3c56fdb46a9994/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_05.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"出動多位舞蹈員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/83a90a563d0590ed4d76a2d604fb156c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_10.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"自彈自唱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/4313bb8bcd5bbac495953faf03e02462/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_14.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"著知裙不介意露腳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/624e62d3e118849a1dfcdf8227eef1dc/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_17_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"衛蘭更企上環場360度高空吊籃繞場一周。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/fc6c03a46b8a5eab98fa899e32384be4/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_17_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"衛蘭更企上環場360度高空吊籃繞場一周。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/1cda09af24b7f05bed62ad1da6a9ae35/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_18.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"中間更有黃淑蔓驚喜現身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/2e30d6de8b57ec380681cbc43e060a26/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_19_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"全場大合唱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/e9a58af7b94e7ed49ec1fa40d2412af1/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_20.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"播放不少入行片段。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/078f3cb527ff98c5f74ba0cf8473e0f4/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_21.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"播放不少入行片段。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/008057447a4c01ef72d559e43ee3a520/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_23.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"分享感受。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/877f814fce84540fc7cf8ba02e3b52bd/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_25.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>衛蘭請來蔡一智和蔡一傑擔任嘉賓</h2>\n<p>來到演唱會尾聲，高潮一浪接一浪，更有草蜢其中兩位，蔡一智和蔡一傑擔任嘉賓，唱《Lonely》和《永遠愛著您》。最後的環節，DJ Tommy出現在台中央，穿上Rapper造型的衛蘭和家麗（KALAI）亦出現在台上唱跳勁舞《Wonderland》、《Sugar in the Marmalade》，更有黎明的《越夜越有機》。是晚演唱會不設Encore環節，約於11點15分完場，但仍有不少觀眾留下大喊：「Encore！」隔了一會，衛蘭從後台走回台上，輕聲勸說觀眾離開：「我要留力呀，仲有三場演唱會。你哋安全返屋企，OK？Get some rest，Thank you so much。」</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/8c6469287fc2531a0a75fbd3ecc86c7c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_27_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/1be7b8ec40f3671e1cf95cb81e059bbc/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_28_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/0a4c300374f7293a84938eb0dfa33338/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_28.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/edd770ef8ef74488e72b1de571d0d631/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_29_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/a04a41f98e94d5651b3003e5e5bfb860/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_29_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/354cdf574db59fb65ba58af72002d122/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_29.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/81285feec3dc1d68d99d8c9d65d08144/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_30.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/36d629850ccaedb7d412ebd588ecd7cb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_31_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/6115669120155fa754ce7b7089fcce45/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_31.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/e254653a61e1203902a846a0a69b6e6e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_34_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/8a0fcb488512d6634efe9b7088bfaf3b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_35.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/f191bf66b0333ddc5899c61c36feff7c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_36.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/9ca13e977067276b775fb47bbbafdd52/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_37_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/8b2b6d3af320bf5c7157d45bacd8ba8a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_01_02_39.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T04:35:32.525708+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":933,"images":63,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T13:56:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T04:49:26.551921+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T04:29:11.725917+00:00","content_hash":"cd3a614c9586213223ddbc98e7eb3e9a74389ea5993852ae9ad83e06cefe623e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}